# Opts (actions/actions_opts.kbd)
**opts + 1**        -- Set Quiet Profile (asusctl profile set Quiet)
**opts + 2**        -- Set Balanced Profile (asusctl profile set Balanced)
**opts + 3**        -- Set Performance Profile (asusctl profile set Performance)
**opts + rsft + k** -- Restart Kwanata (RA-spc [300ms] systemctl --user restart kwanata [300ms] [ent])
**opts + lsft + q** -- Restart System (systemctl reboot)
**opts + rsft + q** -- Shutdown System (systemctl shutdown)
**opts + p**        -- Print Screen (prnt)
**opts + lsft + p** -- Print Window (S-prnt)
**opts + lsft + k** -- Sync And Reload Kanata (kanata_sync.sh; lrld)
**opts + k**        -- Reload Kanata (lrld)
**opts + q**        -- Sleep System (systemctl suspend)
**opts + v**        -- Toggle Verbose
